    "algorithm": "For nonzero a and r, use T_k=k(k-1)/2 and r^(ij)=r^T_(i+j)r^(-T_i)r^(-T_j), then compute the resulting cross-correlation by one fixed 32-point radix-2 NTT convolution. Handle a=0 and r=0 directly.",
    "independent_algorithm": "Evaluate each geometric point independently with Horner's recurrence.",
    "output_layout": "M little-endian signed 64-bit values in increasing i order.",
    "error_precedence": "Malformed input returns -1 before output checks. Valid input with null output or capacity below the exact output size returns -2 without writes."
